[[File:Buck anime.png|thumb|250px|Buck in {{aniseries|DP}}]]
====''Pokémon the Series: Diamond and Pearl''====
Buck is an amateur treasure hunter who was searching for rarities with the help of Baltoy's senses. He appeared in ''[[DP181|Bucking the Treasure Trend!]]'', where he met up with {{Ash}} and {{ashfr}} on the same ferry bound for [[Lily of the Valley Island]]. Unlike the other passengers who were headed for the [[Sinnoh League]], Buck was actually getting off at the nearby [[Dandelion Island]] so he could look for treasures after uncovering a map during one of his other expeditions.

With the help of Ash's group, Buck was able to find the island's treasure, ancient pottery, at an ancient ruin site. He also managed to capture a powerful {{p|Claydol}}. Buck revealed that he wanted to become an archaeology professor. He said farewell to the group and planned to head to [[Stark Mountain]] to uncover more treasures.

